man-node","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This program helps encoding and decoding a text file. It has two parts. The methods in // the first part helps encoding by firstly passing an array of characters frequences, // and secodnly building a binary tree based on the characters values and frequencies, and thirdly writing the binary tree with values and frequencies into an output file.","topics":[],"score":220904,"global_rank":204646},{"name":"yjia757-2/question-tree","owner":"yjia757-2","html_url":"https://github.com/yjia757-2/question-tree","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This assignment will give you practice with binary trees. You are to implement a yes/no guessing game. The idea is that you construct a binary tree where each leaf has the name of an object and each branch node has a yes/no question that distinguishes between the objects.","topics":[],"score":220904,"global_rank":204647},{"name":"yjia757-2/grammar-solver","owner":"yjia757-2","html_url":"https://github.com/yjia757-2/grammar-solver","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This program help the user randomly generates elements of the grammar. Once the  // user choose one of the exist rules, it will randomly generate content that is only made up by the terminal symbols. This program will generate the given number of occurrences of the results.  ","topics":[],"score":220904,"global_rank":204648},{"name":"yjia757-2/hangman-manager","owner":"yjia757-2","html_url":"https://github.com/yjia757-2/hangman-manager","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Java","description":"This programs keeps track of the state of a game of hangman. Unlike the usual hangman game, this program keeps updating a wide selection of words with the same pattern based on what the user has guessed. It delays picking a word until it is forced to.","topics":[],"score":220904,"global_rank":204649